Usage: contract-cli [--json | --plain] [--tag <tag>]... [<file>...]

Options:
  --json                      JSON output
  --plain                     Plain output
  -m, --mode <fast|slow>       Choose execution mode
  --output=<file>             Write the output file
  --color[=always|never]       Control color optionally
  --help[:compat]             Show optional compatibility help
  --tag <tag>                 Add a tag multiple times
  --directory <directory>     Choose a directory

Commands:
  widgets list                List installed widgets
